00:14:09.490 --> 00:14:10.323
- [Heather] Yes.

00:14:10.323 --> 00:14:12.930
- Their sense of pain
and joy and love and hate

00:14:12.930 --> 00:14:16.179
and hunger, and all of
that is inside the brain.

00:14:16.179 --> 00:14:17.600
- Yes.
- Okay.

00:14:17.600 --> 00:14:19.770
- That is true, so
everything you experience is,

00:14:19.770 --> 00:14:22.640
pain, every sensation
you have is happening

00:14:22.640 --> 00:14:25.510
inside of your brain, right, yes, but.

00:14:25.510 --> 00:14:27.187
- So therefore, to the question,

00:14:29.140 --> 00:14:30.720
so the answer to that is yes,

00:14:30.720 --> 00:14:34.670
everything is a brain
experience in your life,

00:14:34.670 --> 00:14:36.770
and you couldn't have had a plausible plot

00:14:36.770 --> 00:14:38.650
